#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:3
#: 275170e5185a47a68943ed0c34f636e6
msgid "Continuous integration (CI)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:6
#: 6c0b1a04130c478895fc58b67c97080a
msgid ""
"This page explains the `continuous integration (CI) <https://en.wikipedia."
"org/wiki/Continuous_integration>`__ infrastructure that the Qubes OS Project "
"uses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:9
#: e46d4c5091a7405bb177e6208ccf33d8
msgid "Website and documentation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:12
#: d25a2b8b0891405c93fa196464530789
msgid ""
"The following commands may be useful as a way to interact with our CI "
"infrastructure on website (`qubesos.github.io <https://github.com/QubesOS/"
"qubesos.github.io>`__) and documentation (`qubes-doc <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS/qubes-doc>`__) pull requests (PRs). Note that special permissions "
"may be required to use some of these commands. These commands are generally "
"issued by adding a comment to a PR containing only the command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:14
#: 69ccc8e13b9845b78199e329559e1152
msgid ""
"``PipelineRetry``: Attempts to run the entire build pipeline over again. "
"This can be useful if CI incorrectly uses a stale branch instead of testing "
"the PR as if it were merged into ``master``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:16
#: 485fe1420a3f43f6b8bc3aeb3d44dcb2
msgid ""
"``PipelineRetryFailed``: Retry just failed CI jobs. Do not update the branch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:18
#: edd13ca0b29a4bcfa97c7f80a6fc18ef
msgid ""
"``PipelineRefresh``: Like ``PipelineRetry``, except it only fetches the job "
"status from GitLab. It doesn’t schedule a new build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/continuous-integration.rst:20
#: 08c76594f1254ddcad3477584c824a28
msgid ""
"``TestDeploy``: Deploys a test website, which is a live version of the Qubes "
"website as if this PR had been merged. This can be useful for previewing a "
"PR on a live public website. **Note:** You must wait for the site to finish "
"building before issuing this command, or else it will deploy an empty "
"website. To find the URL of the test website, look for text similar to “This "
"branch was successfully deployed” and a button named something like “View "
"deployment.” Note that there are two different testing sites: ``wwwtest`` is "
"manually updated, whereas ``wwwpreview`` is managed by the ``TestDeploy`` "
"command."
msgstr ""
